{"type":"message","id":"417eeab7","parentId":"baa49953","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:33:50.132Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 18:33 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: 实现二进制序列化优化 collect_interface()\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\n正在优化 cgnsMeshCutter 的 ParMETIS 剖分算法。已完成 P0-1 负载均衡优化和点对点稀疏通信优化，现需优化字符串序列化效率。\n\n## 当前问题\n\n**位置**: `src/metisCutter.cpp` 第 56-97 行\n\n当前 `packInterface()` 和 `unpackInterface()` 使用字符串序列化：\n```cpp\n// 打包：字符串拼接 (效率低)\nauto packInterface = [&, this]() -> std::string {\n    std::string sendStr;\n    for (auto ifile : outerFace_) {\n        sendStr += (std::to_string(ifile.first) + \":\");\n        for (auto face : ifile.second) { \n            sendStr += (std::to_string(face.first) + \";\"); \n        }\n        sendStr += \"#\";\n    }\n    return sendStr;\n};\n\n// 解包：字符串分割 + 类型转换 (效率低)\nauto unpackInterface = [&, this](const std::string &recvStr) {\n    for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\")) {\n        auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n        auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n        for (auto faceHash : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { \n            nbrOuterface.insert({std::stoull(faceHash), {}});\n        }\n    }\n};\n```\n\n**问题**:\n- 多次内存分配 (每个数字转字符串)\n- 多次字符串分割和类型转换\n- CPU 开销大\n\n## 优化方案\n\n### 二进制消息格式设计\n\n```cpp\n#pragma pack(push, 1)\nstruct InterfaceMessageHeader {\n    uint32_t magic;       // 魔数 0x494E5446 (\"INTF\")\n    uint16_t version;     // 版本号 0x0001\n    uint16_t flags;       // 保留\n    uint32_t entry_count; // file entries 数量\n    uint32_t reserved;    // 对齐\n};\n\nstruct InterfaceEntryHeader {\n    int32_t  file_id;     // 对应 outerFace_ 的 key\n    uint32_t face_count;  // face hash 数量\n    // 后跟 face_count 个 uint64_t (size_t 的哈希值)\n};\n#pragma pack(pop)\n```\n\n### 实现要求\n\n1. **在 `metisCutter.h` 中添加消息格式定义**\n\n2. **在 `metisCutter.cpp` 中实现二进制序列化函数**：\n   ```cpp\n   std::vector<char> packInterfaceBinary();\n   void unpackInterfaceBinary(const char* data, size_t size);\n   ```\n\n3. **修改 `collect_interface()` 使用二进制格式**：\n   - 替换字符串打包/解包\n   - 保持通信逻辑不变 (点对点稀疏通信)\n\n4. **处理边界情况**：\n   - 空 outerFace_\n   - 大量 interface 数据\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- 环境变量设置：\n  ```bash\n  export CGNS_ROOT=/home/one/app/cgns-4.3.0-int32\n  export METIS_ROOT=/home/one/app/metis-5.1.0-Int32Double\n  export PARMETIS_ROOT=/home/one/app/parmetis-4.0.3-Int32Double\n  ```\n\n- 编译命令：\n  ```bash\n  cd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\n  cmake .. && make -j4\n  ```\n\n## Deliverable\n修改后的 `metisCutter.h` 和 `metisCutter.cpp`，包含：\n1. 二进制消息格式定义\n2. 二进制序列化/反序列化函数\n3. 更新的 `collect_interface()` 函数\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772620430130}}
{"type":"message","id":"af6b10a1","parentId":"417eeab7","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:33:56.792Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand the task:\n\n1. I need to optimize the string serialization in `collect_interface()` function\n2. Replace it with binary serialization\n3. The workspace is `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n4. I need to modify `metisCutter.h` and `metisCutter.cpp`\n\nLet me start by reading the current implementation to understand the context better.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我理解任务：需要将 `collect_interface()` 中的字符串序列化优化为二进制格式。\n\n让我先读取当前的实现："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-96327330c59a401fb94098de2b764d3b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.h"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-b515814ac2364045b43562e9fe4f7e40","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","offset":1,"limit":150}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":10032,"output":249,"cacheRead":3423,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13704,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772620430132}}
{"type":"message","id":"327ce12f","parentId":"af6b10a1","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:33:56.799Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-96327330c59a401fb94098de2b764d3b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <functional>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\n// Hash function for face (vector of cgsize_t)\ninline size_t hashFace(const vector<cgsize_t>& face) {\n    size_t h = 0;\n    for (auto id : face)\n        h ^= std::hash<cgsize_t>{}(id) + 0x9e3779b9 + (h << 6) + (h >> 2);\n    return h;\n}\n\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nclass MetisCutter : public MeshCutter\n{\npublic:\n    MetisCutter();\n    virtual ~MetisCutter();\n\npublic:\n    void cut(int argc, char** argv) override;\n\nprivate:\n    using cgns_filetype = std::shared_ptr<CGFile>;\n    int RANK = 0, SIZE = 1;\n    cgns_filetype bigMesh_;\n    vector<cgns_filetype> smallMesh_;\n    map<int, map<cgsize_t, cgsize_t>> nodeIdG2L_;\n    set<cgsize_t> nodeIds_, cellIds_;\n    vector<idx_t> cellPartition_, nodePartition_;\n    unordered_map<int, unordered_map<size_t, vector<cgsize_t>>> outerFace_;\n    cgsize_t globalOffset_ = 0;\n    set<int> ownerFile_;\n    struct DecomposeResult\n    {\n        idx_t nCellThisRank, start;\n    };\n    struct Cell\n    {\n        idx_t id;   // begin from 1\n        int partId; // begin from 0;\n    };\n    vector<int> ownerThread_;\n\nprivate:\n    void collect_interface();\n    \n    vector<Cell> collect_subBody(const DecomposeResult& decomposeResult, const vector<int>& ownerThread);\n\n    void cut_metis(string mesh, const int np);\n\n    int cut_metis(const vector<vector<idx_t>>& cellToplogy, idx_t np, vector<idx_t>& cellPartition, vector<idx_t>& nodePartition);\n\n    void cut_parmetis(string mesh, const int np);\n\n    int cut_parmetis(idx_t np, vector<idx_t>& elmdist, vector<idx_t>& eptr, vector<idx_t>& eind, vector<idx_t>& cellPartition);\n\n    DecomposeResult decompose_body(const CGFile::Section& bigBody, const int np);\n\n    void updateOwnerThread(string filename, const int np);\n\n    void openSubMeshToWrite(string filename, const int id, const int np);\n\n    void rwBody(const int ifile, const CGFile::Section& bigBody);\n\n    void rwBoundary(const int ifile);\n\n    void rwInterface(const int ifile);\n\n    void rwNode(const int ifile);\n\n    std::string smallMeshName(string bigMeshName, const int id, const int np);\n\n    void updateOuterFace(const CGFile::Section& curS, const int id);\n\n    void writeGlobalInfo(const CGFile::Section& curS, const int id);\n\n    void writeInterface(const int ifile, const int np);\n};\n} // namespace MeshCut\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772620436797}}
{"type":"message","id":"52282135","parentId":"327ce12f","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:33:56.805Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-b515814ac2364045b43562e9fe4f7e40","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#include <algorithm>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <cstring>\n#include <ctime>\n#include <numeric>\n\n#include <cgns_io.h>\n#include <parmetis.h>\n\n#include \"cmdLine.h\"\n#include \"metisCutter.h\"\n#include \"mpiAdapter.h\"\n#include \"stringUtil.h\"\n\nstatic const int DataTAG = 1000;\n\nstatic std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n{\n    vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n    idx_t base = len / n;\n    idx_t remainder = len % n;\n    int rank;\n    MPI_Comm_rank(MPI_COMM_WORLD, &rank);\n    nCellThisRank = base + (rank < remainder ? 1 : 0);\n    MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n    return dist;\n}\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nMetisCutter::MetisCutter() : bigMesh_(nullptr) {}\n\nMetisCutter::~MetisCutter() {}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut(int argc, char **argv)\n{\n    CmdLine cl{};\n    cl.regist<std::string, CmdLine::MustOffer>(\"m\", \"mesh\", \"mesh file name.\", \" \");\n    cl.regist<size_t, CmdLine::MustOffer>(\"np\", \"npart\", \"part number of sub-mesh.\", \" \");\n    cl.parse(argc, argv);\n\n    MPIAdapter::Initialize(&argc, &argv);\n#ifdef DEBUG_MODE\n    if (!MPIAdapter::isParallel() || (MPIAdapter::isParallel() && MPIAdapter::isMaster()))\n    {\n        std::cout << \"DEBUG_MODE: type any char to continue\\n\";\n        auto a = std::getchar();\n    }\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n#endif\n    MPIAdapter::isParallel() ? this->cut_parmetis(cl.get<std::string>(\"mesh\"), cl.get<size_t>(\"npart\")) : this->cut_metis(cl.get<std::string>(\"mesh\"), cl.get<size_t>(\"npart\"));\n}\n\n// collect interface from all other threads\nvoid MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    // Pack interface data into a string for sending\n    auto packInterface = [&, this]() -> std::string\n    {\n        std::string sendStr;\n        for (auto ifile : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (ifile.second.empty()) continue;\n\n            sendStr += (std::to_string(ifile.first) + \":\");\n            for (auto face : ifile.second) { sendStr += (std::to_string(face.first) + \";\"); }\n            sendStr += \"#\";\n        }\n\n        return sendStr;\n    };\n\n    // Unpack received interface data\n    auto unpackInterface = [&, this](const std::string &recvStr)\n    {\n        for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\"))\n        {\n            if (ifile.empty()) continue;\n            auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n            if (cur.size() < 2) continue;\n            auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n\n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, stringSplit(cur[1], \";\").size(), nbrFile));\n\n            auto &nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (auto faceHash : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { \n                if (!faceHash.empty()) {\n                    nbrOuterface.insert({std::stoull(faceHash), {}});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    std::string sendTmp = packInterface();\n    int sendCnt = sendTmp.size();\n\n    // Step 1: Determine which ranks have data to send (non-empty send buffer)\n    std::vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, 0);\n    sendCnts[RANK] = sendCnt;\n    MPI_Allgather(&sendCnt, 1, MPI_INT, sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    // Step 2: Identify target ranks (those with non-empty data)\n    std::vector<int> targetRanks;\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            targetRanks.push_back(i);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Step 3: Use point-to-point communication only with target ranks\n    std::vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    std::vector<int> recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n    std::vector<std::string> recvBuffers(SIZE);\n    std::vector<char*> recvBuffersPtr(SIZE, nullptr);\n\n    // Post non-blocking receives from all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            recvCnt[i] = sendCnts[i];\n            recvBuffers[i].assign(recvCnt[i] + 1, '\\0');\n            recvBuffersPtr[i] = const_cast<char*>(recvBuffers[i].data());\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Irecv(recvBuffersPtr[i], recvCnt[i], MPI_CHAR, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Post non-blocking sends to all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[RANK] > 0) {\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Isend(const_cast<char*>(sendTmp.data()), sendCnt, MPI_CHAR, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Wait for all communications to complete\n    if (!requests.empty()) {\n        std::vector<MPI_Status> statuses(requests.size());\n        MPIAdapter::WaitAll(requests.size(), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    }\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    // Process received data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0 && !recvBuffers[i].empty()) {\n            unpackInterface(recvBuffers[i]);\n\n[586 more lines in file. Use offset=151 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772620436803}}
