{"type":"message","id":"f69fe6ab","parentId":"8e124545","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:34:05.808Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-bb646dfa7c8141869607d55a80081a47","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"void MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    // Pack interface data into a string for sending\n    auto packInterface = [&, this]() -> std::string\n    {\n        std::string sendStr;\n        for (auto ifile : outerFace_)\n        {\n            if (ifile.second.empty()) continue;\n\n            sendStr += (std::to_string(ifile.first) + \":\");\n            for (auto face : ifile.second) { sendStr += (std::to_string(face.first) + \";\"); }\n            sendStr += \"#\";\n        }\n\n        return sendStr;\n    };\n\n    // Unpack received interface data\n    auto unpackInterface = [&, this](const std::string &recvStr)\n    {\n        for (auto ifile : stringSplit(recvStr, \"#\"))\n        {\n            if (ifile.empty()) continue;\n            auto cur = stringSplit(ifile, \":\");\n            if (cur.size() < 2) continue;\n            auto nbrFile = std::stoi(cur[0]);\n            if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) continue;\n\n            check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %d interface of file %d\\n\", RANK, stringSplit(cur[1], \";\").size(), nbrFile));\n\n            auto &nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n            for (auto faceHash : stringSplit(cur[1], \";\")) { \n                if (!faceHash.empty()) {\n                    nbrOuterface.insert({std::stoull(faceHash), {}});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    };\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    std::string sendTmp = packInterface();\n    int sendCnt = sendTmp.size();\n\n    // Step 1: Determine which ranks have data to send (non-empty send buffer)\n    std::vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, 0);\n    sendCnts[RANK] = sendCnt;\n    MPI_Allgather(&sendCnt, 1, MPI_INT, sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    // Step 2: Identify target ranks (those with non-empty data)\n    std::vector<int> targetRanks;\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            targetRanks.push_back(i);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Step 3: Use point-to-point communication only with target ranks\n    std::vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    std::vector<int> recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n    std::vector<std::string> recvBuffers(SIZE);\n    std::vector<char*> recvBuffersPtr(SIZE, nullptr);\n\n    // Post non-blocking receives from all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            recvCnt[i] = sendCnts[i];\n            recvBuffers[i].assign(recvCnt[i] + 1, '\\0');\n            recvBuffersPtr[i] = const_cast<char*>(recvBuffers[i].data());\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Irecv(recvBuffersPtr[i], recvCnt[i], MPI_CHAR, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Post non-blocking sends to all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[RANK] > 0) {\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Isend(const_cast<char*>(sendTmp.data()), sendCnt, MPI_CHAR, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Wait for all communications to complete\n    if (!requests.empty()) {\n        std::vector<MPI_Status> statuses(requests.size());\n        MPIAdapter::WaitAll(requests.size(), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    }\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    // Process received data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0 && !recvBuffers[i].empty()) {\n            unpackInterface(recvBuffers[i]);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// collect cell id from all other threads\n\n[581 more lines in file. Use offset=156 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772620445806}}
{"type":"message","id":"edfe83fa","parentId":"f69fe6ab","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:34:23.562Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我理解了完整的 `collect_interface()` 函数。我需要：\n\n1. 在 `metisCutter.h` 中添加二进制消息格式定义\n2. 在 `metisCutter.cpp` 中实现二进制序列化/反序列化函数\n3. 修改 `collect_interface()` 使用二进制格式\n\n让我先检查 outerFace_ 的数据结构：\n```cpp\nunordered_map<int, unordered_map<size_t, vector<cgsize_t>>> outerFace_;\n```\n\n所以：\n- outerFace_ 是一个嵌套的 unordered_map\n- 外层 key: int (file id)\n- 内层 key: size_t (face hash)\n- 内层 value: vector<cgsize_t> (face nodes)\n\n二进制格式设计：\n- InterfaceMessageHeader: 魔数、版本、flags、entry_count、reserved\n- InterfaceEntryHeader: file_id, face_count\n- 后跟 face_count 个 uint64_t (size_t 的哈希值)\n\n让我开始实现：","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在我理解了完整的实现。让我开始实现二进制序列化优化：\n\n**步骤 1**: 在 `metisCutter.h` 中添加二进制消息格式定义"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-0aca09e2d6874fd88caaa41b0d15a452","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.h","oldText":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <functional>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;","newText":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <vector>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\n// ============================================================================\n// Binary message format for interface data serialization\n// ============================================================================\n#pragma pack(push, 1)\nstruct InterfaceMessageHeader {\n    uint32_t magic;       // Magic number: 0x494E5446 (\"INTF\")\n    uint16_t version;     // Version: 0x0001\n    uint16_t flags;       // Reserved flags\n    uint32_t entry_count; // Number of file entries\n    uint32_t reserved;    // Reserved for alignment (total 16 bytes)\n};\n\nstruct InterfaceEntryHeader {\n    int32_t  file_id;     // File ID (key in outerFace_)\n    uint32_t face_count;  // Number of face hashes\n    // Followed by face_count * uint64_t (face hash values)\n};\n#pragma pack(pop)\n\n// Magic number constant\nconstexpr uint32_t INTERFACE_MSG_MAGIC = 0x494E5446; // \"INTF\"\nconstexpr uint16_t INTERFACE_MSG_VERSION = 0x0001;"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":987,"output":827,"cacheRead":16869,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18683,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772620445809}}
